From: LM-G820N Developer <dev@lmg820n.invalid>
Subject: [PATCH] qcom: add native LG AWB OHE and DTB corrections

Retain calibrated nominal RGB references for exception gain targets.
Generate per-sensor OHE thresholds and DTB selection and gain tables.
Apply OHE blending and persistent DTB selection with factory gates,
lux interpolation and reference-to-light mapping.

